{"title":"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" />-plane, the segment with endpoints <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/8406e5f7c765b5c5fcd22a3c9a756da79907ca29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-5,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/3/d63d48ada3e2af8a43938f8f7e05c012ab200a63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(25,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" /> is the diameter of a circle. If the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/7/577b2a9a5b68c5d54164d0801339800b19c35830.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,15)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"18\" /> is on the circle, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff51845797a05fd68c53c81a189bc899dc2537b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=$\" width=\"29\" height=\"8\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/d/c9d2ac53c44121c8f770713464062c867cb28fc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 12.5 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 15\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 17.5 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"422\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that the center of this circle is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/2/1026af1f6345f9b6bd2d1c786d3261df21c8f6ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(\\frac{-5+25}{2},0\\right)=(10,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"187\" height=\"45\" />. The radius is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/6/6461e80d38683920cf764ccfcf59225de8def35f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{30}{2}=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"64\" height=\"37\" />. So the equation of this circle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6e11d7340aac514d5298cdf1b56c599775a7314.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x-10)^2+y^2=225.\\]\" width=\"164\" height=\"19\" /> Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/889e0b5ebc2bd86228677235c2b31785eec67c39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/e/2aeff4e9a715c4d9efcf0f2f2556cacf6aaac5b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-10)^2=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"19\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/0/d20975ab5c17d413c445d9320f6ebc5336d1580f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"100\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>--Solution by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=200685\">TheMaskedMagician</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The diameter of the circle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/f/00f9adc9b8b94e1ea3d284c77134d79c50d6fa12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25- (-5)=30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"119\" height=\"18\" /> so the radius is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the center of the circle is on the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-axis at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/1/ec186fd1809357d1f530bee2334ceb59d405b4f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" />.  The only point with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/889e0b5ebc2bd86228677235c2b31785eec67c39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" /> must be the point exactly above the center.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME\" title=\"1994 AHSME\">1994 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1994 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1994\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1994_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1994 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/